{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "01951c7e-c830-46f1-8a5a-84a9d9995133",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3075",
            "content": {
                "en": "Excuse me, are all these puppets handmade?",
                "zh": "您好，这些都是手工制成的木偶吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 205.59999084472657,
            "positionY": -135.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "01caa6ed-12f3-46b0-9378-847380577f0d",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager3_3",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager3_3",
                    "methodName": "CameraZoomIn_3_3",
                    "stringParameter": "",
                    "intParameter": 0,
                    "floatParameter": 0.0,
                    "boolParameter": false,
                    "parameterType": 0,
                    "triggerTiming": 0
                }
            ],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bcaf3f7d-c37a-4192-a675-10d3cb0aa902",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3076",
            "content": {
                "en": "Of course! This craft has been passed down for generations!",
                "zh": "那当然！这可是代代流传下来的手艺！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 552.7999877929688,
            "positionY": -134.39999389648438,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "da241eb6-deba-4e60-a49e-92093cde6868",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3077",
            "content": {
                "en": "Look at the patterns here—tsk, tsk—and the carving details here…",
                "zh": "你看这里的花纹，啧啧，再看这里的雕刻细节......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 900.7999877929688,
            "positionY": -135.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a317d114-c409-404c-a0d3-e4bc5903db68",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3078",
            "content": {
                "en": "(He seems really passionate about puppets.)",
                "zh": "（他似乎相当热衷于木偶。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1237.5999755859375,
            "positionY": -135.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "77cacd5f-ea00-466c-9044-3bb2307fe732",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3079",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Wait, the strings connecting these puppets look a bit like the ones I saw on the plane.)",
                "zh": "（等等，连接这些木偶的丝线，和我在飞机上看到的有些类似。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1588.0,
            "positionY": -131.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a380041e-c583-4479-ad07-c9b64b6d0769",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3080",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Maybe I can find out how to deal with those strings.)",
                "zh": "（或许能打听出对付那些丝线的手段。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1968.0,
            "positionY": -133.60000610351563,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "77360858-6f84-428b-b840-292e154f02a8",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3081",
            "content": {
                "en": "Sorry to bother you. I actually collect puppets as a hobby.",
                "zh": "打扰了，其实我有收藏木偶的爱好。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2342.39990234375,
            "positionY": -124.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "dbf1a58c-6259-4fe6-9895-4dc444431c66",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3082",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh! Then you’ve come to the right place! Yuntai’s handmade puppets are famous, you know.",
                "zh": "噢！那你可来对了地方了！我们芸台的手作木偶可是很有名气的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2729.599853515625,
            "positionY": -122.39999389648438,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "203999a2-d877-48b9-9f2e-7647bce2fd60",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3083",
            "content": {
                "en": "That’s exactly why I’m here. I’ve bought some puppets from Yuntai before.",
                "zh": "我正是慕名而来，之前也在芸台购置过一些木偶。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3119.199951171875,
            "positionY": -111.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bbbaa235-7027-4e8b-bdec-523570a1696c",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3084",
            "content": {
                "en": "It’s just that the puppets I keep, their strings often snap on their own and I can never figure out why.",
                "zh": "只是我保存的木偶，丝线常常会自己断裂，却又找不到原因。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3503.199951171875,
            "positionY": -114.4000015258789,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f1e9ba78-6f15-4168-9d1e-db0064cff64c",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3085",
            "content": {
                "en": "The strings snapping, huh… If it’s not external damage, it could be a temperature issue.",
                "zh": "丝线断裂啊......如果不是被外物破坏，那有可能是温度因素影响。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3882.39990234375,
            "positionY": -110.4000015258789,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8d7956ce-25eb-4f9a-bb50-614821baf57f",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3086",
            "content": {
                "en": "Temperature?",
                "zh": "温度？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4278.400390625,
            "positionY": -102.4000015258789,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9f3d4d5e-2c40-43e4-8e46-99fa1ce3dd3d",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3087",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yep. The oldest local puppet-making methods used spider silk to connect the joints.",
                "zh": "嗯，我们本地最古老的木偶做法，便是使用蛛丝连接木偶关节的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4659.2001953125,
            "positionY": -98.4000015258789,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0ec05cbc-36f2-41e7-a228-c50fccb9e40f",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3088",
            "content": {
                "en": "These days almost no craftsmen use real spider silk anymore, but locals still use light, fine thread that imitates it.",
                "zh": "虽然现代基本已经没有完全使用蛛丝的匠人了，但本地人还是会用较轻而细，能够仿照蛛丝的丝类进行替代。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5046.400390625,
            "positionY": -96.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "1853a520-e057-4559-97b3-0efe08c5018c",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3089",
            "content": {
                "en": "Puppets made this way move more lightly, but they’re also more sensitive to temperature.",
                "zh": "这样做出的木偶活动起来更加轻盈，但是也更易受温度影响。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5418.400390625,
            "positionY": -95.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a942c34b-d6fe-40d4-9655-3e04d0ecd206",
            "index": 15,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3090",
            "content": {
                "en": "If the temperature gets too low or too high…",
                "zh": "如果温度太低或太高的话......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5784.80029296875,
            "positionY": -91.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "35b7cc9a-4cd4-434d-a89a-19ecc4428986",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3091",
            "content": {
                "en": "<color=red>High temperatures will cause the threads to soften and dissolve; low temperatures make them brittle and easy to snap.</color> So you have to control the temperature when storing them.",
                "zh": "<color=red>温度太高丝线会溶解，太低则容易脆化断裂</color>，所以保存时要控制好温度。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6151.2001953125,
            "positionY": -87.19999694824219,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b9180462-af33-4ae4-9b38-137d1acd6069",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3092",
            "content": {
                "en": "Thank you so much! That really helps!",
                "zh": "非常感谢您！真是帮了大忙了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6551.2001953125,
            "positionY": -86.4000015258789,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d6a831ed-fa6d-446a-af70-e987ed13b3ec",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3093",
            "content": {
                "en": "Hahaha, you’re very welcome! It’s been a long time since I met someone who likes puppets this much!",
                "zh": "哈哈哈哈哈不客气不客气！好久没遇到这么喜欢木偶的人了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6931.2001953125,
            "positionY": -86.4000015258789,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bf92937e-6a2a-4fc5-9050-d74612a9d000",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "a574d8c1-b22f-414c-a0c4-cbcaece98de6",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3094",
            "content": {
                "en": "If you see me at the fair tomorrow, remember to come say hi. I’ll give you a discount!",
                "zh": "明天大会上见到，记得来打声招呼，我给你打折！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7304.0,
            "positionY": -84.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "91f947b3-65ac-41cc-b30a-5d7d27354ada",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3095",
            "content": {
                "en": "Okay, I definitely will!",
                "zh": "好，我一定来！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7676.0,
            "positionY": -80.80000305175781,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
                    "targetObjectID": "01caa6ed-12f3-46b0-9378-847380577f0d",
                    "targetObjectName": "LevelManager3_3",
                    "componentTypeName": "LevelManager3_3",
